  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.\n• Finely chop red onion (see ingredients) and garlic.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Cut paneer into 1cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fc16e4158183d5d9196/step-146ad700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook potato and cauliflower in the boiling water over high heat until easily pierced with a fork, 15-20 minutes.\n• Drain and return to the pan. Add half Mumabi spice blend, the butter (for the mash) and a good pinch of salt. Mash until smooth.\n• TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fc16e4158183d5d9196/step-c81eec10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-hight heat.\n• Cook half the chopped onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• In the last minute, add tomato paste and garlic, stirring until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fc16e4158183d5d9196/step-0b0d2720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, add paneer, the remaining Mumbai spice blend and the water. Simmer, gently stirring occasionally, until paneer is heated through and tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add mashed veggies and the softened butter. Stir to combine.\n• Remove from heat and add a generous squeeze of lemon juice.\n• TIP: Add a splash more water if the bhaji looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fc16e4158183d5d9196/step-661ff430.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Just before serving, halve bake-at-home burger buns and toast or grill to your liking.\n• Spread the butter (for the bread) over cut sides of the buns.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fc16e4158183d5d9196/step-dd36c340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide paneer bhaji between bowls.\n• Top with red onion and chilli. Tear over coriander.\n• Serve with toasted buns, mango chutney and any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fc16e4158183d5d9196/step-1c255f50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
